From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saon Islam <saonbd33@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci(instapaper): stop tagging bookmark-sync commits [skip ci]

Cloudflare Workers Builds skips any commit whose message contains
"[skip ci]", so the bookmark-sync commits never triggered a rebuild and
/read kept serving the old bookmark list (the data file in main was up
to date, the deployed HTML was not). GitHub does not re-run workflows for
pushes made with the automatic GITHUB_TOKEN, so dropping the tag does not
cause loops — it only lets the site rebuild.
---
 .github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml       | 2 +-
 .github/workflows/instapaper-on-publish.yml | 2 +-
 .github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml        | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml b/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml
index 3376399..0317fde 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml
@@ -49,5 +49,5 @@ jobs:
           git config user.email "41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com"
           git add -f data/instapaper-bookmarks.json data/read-queue-state.json
           git diff --cached --quiet && exit 0
-          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks [skip ci]"
+          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks"
           git push
diff --git a/.github/workflows/instapaper-on-publish.yml b/.github/workflows/instapaper-on-publish.yml
index 5121faf..36d8fd6 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/instapaper-on-publish.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/instapaper-on-publish.yml
@@ -97,5 +97,5 @@ jobs:
           git config user.email "41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com"
           git add -f data/instapaper-bookmarks.json
           git diff --cached --quiet && exit 0
-          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks after new post [skip ci]"
+          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks after new post"
           git push
diff --git a/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml b/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml
index d501002..1c372c8 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml
@@ -123,7 +123,7 @@ jobs:
           git config user.email "41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com"
           git add -f data/instapaper-bookmarks.json data/read-queue-state.json
           git diff --cached --quiet && exit 0
-          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks after publish [skip ci]"
+          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks after publish"
           git pull --rebase origin main || true
           git push origin HEAD:main
 
